WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:21.400
This is the collated data on the soldiers that are coming home.

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:23.300
91% of the whole is complete.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:28.740
We've confirmed the registry codes on just about all of the surviving soldiers.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:33.370
Has 2805... Have Marlene and Yuji's survival been confirmed?

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:36.580
No, not yet. According to the communications checks

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:40.680
from the shuttles en route, they are unconfirmed.

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:42.690
I see.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.120
So, you were unable to stop him then, Marlene?

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:56.190
I found a shuttle that can still fly.

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:59.360
It now looks like we'll manage to return to the station.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.590
We'll take off once the rain stops.

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:09.270
Yuji...

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:23.060
It appears as if we've been keeping you waiting.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.720
Seno Miyagi.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:28.120
You must also know the outcome of the second airborne operation.

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:30.750
Have you decided yet to surrender peacefully?

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.660
How do you mean?

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:35.060
I mean that the Sleeper brigades that you were expecting so much from

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:37.330
have already had it.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:39.870
This is the outcome of your long years of educating

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:43.000
and restricting people according to military regulations.

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:46.480
There is no one now who will follow your orders.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:50.000
Indeed, your plans were in error.

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:53.750
In error? How is it that we were in error

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:56.190
in our efforts to eliminate the Blue from the Earth

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:58.020
and place it back in the hands of men?

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:02.550
It is a matter of methodology.
B cells are beyond our control.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:05.690
Even by using the Sleeper's power to dispense with the Blue,

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:09.700
in time, those Sleepers will again threaten our lives.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:11.360
Seno Miyagi...

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:15.030
It is you who is answerable to for part of that plan.

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:17.700
I just have to correct that error.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:22.040
Are you saying that ignoring the requests for reinforcements was also to that end?

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:26.710
In any event, I admit that the plan did need reexamination.

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:30.380
Let us proceed with the next operation more cautiously.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:35.360
The next operation!? Ridiculous! Having been driven from the military station,

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:40.330
and losing all means of procuring resources, what can you do?

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.660
That's true...

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:44.790
That is why we have decided to first request

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:49.000
that you vacate the military facilities.

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:53.010
Bullshit! Did you really think that we would agree to that request?

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:59.350
Of course. The terms toward that end rest in our hands, after all.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:02.120
Have you forgotten? That in the medical station,

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:04.780
there is a residential section where ordinary people

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:07.020
who have escaped the Earth are sleeping?

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.060
300,000 lives, who know nothing,

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:13.360
and were put to sleep in order to protect our few resources...

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.090
Do not forget the fact that by chasing us out,

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:21.370
you threaten their existence at the same time.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.380
Is that intended as a threat?

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:28.040
Don't be silly. Ultimately, these are gentlemanly negotiations.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.950
If you do advocate a humanitarian position,

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:36.650
I expect we will certainly be hearing a congenial response from you.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:39.320
That is all...

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:41.330
Victor!

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:43.390
Sore losing bastard!

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:51.200
- President Victor...
- There is nothing to worry about.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:55.000
This will buy us a little time.

00:06:55.070 --> 00:06:57.910
But still, the military facilities are in their hands.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:01.000
lf, by any chance, Seno were to resort to drastic measures...

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:05.310
Supposing they were to come swarming in, all there is for us is to fight.

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:10.350
Unless, you think that gun hanging from your waist is for decoration.

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:12.020
N, no...

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:13.250
Still...

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.030
Lu.

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:18.900
Yes?

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:24.040
Are you aware of why it is that Seno is so fearful of the Sleepers?

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:26.700
W- well, I...

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:28.240
Given that you spent a long time up to now

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.940
working on the staff of the science division,

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:33.570
you must have a general idea...

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:38.640
But it is too late to back away now.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:41.650
I still believe. Yes...

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:46.750
The only thing that can save us are the Sleepers, with their B cells.

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:55.790
I'll put it on the monitor.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:03.270
This is transport shuttle 0041, come in Second Earth.

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:07.010
This is the 7th Sleeper Brigade, Tony Frost...

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:11.680
Repeating, this is Code Number S-105, Tony Frost.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:18.020
Alicia Whistle is with me. Requesting emergency landing instructions.

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:22.030
We just received a transmission from shuttle 0041. Tony is piloting it!

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.690
What!?

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:26.360
Alive? Tony?

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:29.370
He's attempting to land at the station. What shall we do?

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:31.660
No! Seal off the dock!

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:33.970
Don't let him near!

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:38.640
A state of emergency... A state of emergency...

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:45.480
Now sealing off all docks. Now sealing off all docks.

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:55.160
Tony... Tony?

00:08:56.730 --> 00:09:00.670
Look! See? The Sleepers are here, aren't they?

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:04.000
They won't be beaten so easily!

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:08.340
Lead that shuttle in! Hurry!

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:11.670
Please wait!! You intend to accept him!?

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:16.840
Of course. You know of his activities down on the surface as well, right?

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:19.350
If we had a highly stimulated Sleeper...

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:23.360
With just one of them here, we should even be able to reverse the current situation.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:24.360
But...

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:27.690
There is a reason Seno has rejected them...

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:30.890
It is dangerous to blindly trust in the Sleepers' abilities.

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:36.960
If we are to receive him, we should at least...

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:41.970
- President...!
- Right. The president of Second Earth is not Seno.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:46.740
It is I. Up until now, and from here on out.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:56.150
Reply confirmed. The shuttle is arriving on the 2nd bridge,

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:57.660
in approximately five minutes.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.160
Let's go.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:03.360
Don't...

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:08.930
Don't! Wait, Victor!

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:20.180
Very soon, everything will return to normal.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:24.270
Indeed, I must always be correct.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.300
We welcome you, Tony.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:44.630
Now, with your power, you will prove that we are the ones who are just.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:26.670
This is Code Number 2805, Marlene Angel. Second Earth, please respond.

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:29.080
This is Marlene!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:36.320
It's no use. Let's go, Yuji.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:46.360
Yuji...

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.040
Shake it off...

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:55.040
Everyone...

00:11:55.110 --> 00:12:02.040
I wanted to save everyone. Really, that's all. And yet, why did I...

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:08.720
You've done well. It wasn't your fault, Yuji.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:14.490
I wanted to win! But that wasn't it... I...

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:26.060
Don't think about anything now. It's all right, very soon we can go home.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.400
The two of us, to Second Earth.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:31.700
The same Yuji as ever.

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:47.030
Emergency deployment!! Precautionary Mode!

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:49.790
L2X! Hurry!

00:12:56.440 --> 00:13:00.370
Hey, what's all the racket about!? What the hell is going on!?

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:03.470
We're having a simulation of your posts right now!

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:06.380
Stand by and do what the monitors display!

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:07.470
Display?

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.720
- W- what is this!?
- B- Blue!

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:30.070
W- what!? Why are there Blue in the medical station!?

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:36.370
You appear pretty surprised, people of Second Earth.

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:37.340
Tony!

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:42.610
I never thought the situation up here would have changed so much.

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:48.020
I really was planning on going straight there. Of course,

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.350
bringing these guys along...

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:52.020
- What!?
- It's him that brought the Blue up!?

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:55.030
- Why do he and the Blue not mind each other!?
- Is he leading the Blue?

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:58.190
Tony... why you... For you to go and pull something like this...

00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:00.700
What are you planning to do!?

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:06.030
What now? It's just as you are thinking,

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.370
Seno Miyagi...

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:11.710
Look, it's very simple. See...

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:17.180
In the western year 2017, the Blue first started being born

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:22.710
among all the surface's cities, in order to devour the humans.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:28.060
If the Blue's true character is that of an evolved form of the B cell,

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:34.360
then the Sleepers were born for the same reason. Isn't that so?

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:38.930
Impossible! You intend to group yourself as the same kind of monster as the Blue?

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:42.340
You are a human, the same as us, aren't you?

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:43.640
A human, such as yourself,

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:46.010
has no authority to judge the rest of us, mankind!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:50.110
It's no use. The birth of the Blue, as well as my waking up to this world,

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:53.670
was no accident. You see...

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:57.250
It was decided many, many years ago,

00:14:57.320 --> 00:15:02.690
a grand design that the hands of man could not reach. After all...

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:06.030
...you guys were in the way.

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:08.360
No matter, you will understand soon.

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:12.700
I'll be heading over there right away. And for the occasion...

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:14.710
I'm coming, this station and all.

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:16.370
Station and all!?

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:18.880
Anyone who does not wish to greet us

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:22.040
is free to run away to wherever they will. Of course...

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:25.380
that supposes there is anywhere to go.

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:30.050
Wait, Tony! Tony!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:32.020
What is he saying!?

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:34.990
He's doing what with the station?

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:38.550
Is he planning on crashing the medical station into us!?

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:41.330
Stop him! No matter what it takes!

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:43.330
Switch from precautionary condition to battle mode!

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:45.670
All personnel, make haste to confirm preparations for battle!

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:48.670
Our target is the medical station!

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:50.000
W- what!?

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:55.170
The High Council has been wiped out? What happened to Lu!? Lu!!

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:10.350
All hands on deck! Anyone that can move head for Deck D-3 or D-5!

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:12.360
H- hey, hold on, Su!

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:16.370
Su!!

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:17.530
You're coming too!

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:01.770
The medical station's defensive systems are operational!

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:03.340
We can't get within firing range!

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:07.010
What do we do about the residential sections? Give them up for lost?

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:08.880
Cut the residential sections off from the station!

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:12.360
Assign troops to recover them in space!

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.550
I cannot access the main computer!

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:18.360
A write-protect that Victor set has come alive!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:20.020
Don't rely on formation!

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.900
Spread the enemy's defense line out, and secure,

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:25.370
even in just one place, an approach point!

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:28.030
Once we invade, relocate to Block B-6!

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:31.340
Use the manual controls to release the residential section!

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:44.650
- All right, let's go!
- Okay!

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.360
Is that...?

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:30.700
Contact with K2, K3 has been cut off.

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:32.330
The advance party is down to three vehicles!

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:35.310
Liberate Deck D-5! We can get more pilots!!

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:37.310
Bring the list of returned soldiers around!

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:39.310
Are reinforcements still on stand-by!?

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:40.970
They're coming in 98 seconds...

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:42.980
That's too slow! Send them in one minute!

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:43.980
Roger!

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:46.310
How can this be?

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:50.650
With all our power, even we cannot stop Tony's recklessness!

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:55.320
This is Code Number 2805, Marlene Angel.

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:58.330
Station, please respond! This is Marlene!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.990
Marlene!?

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:04.000
This is the military station! Marlene? Is Yuji with you?

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:09.010
Seno Miyagi? We've been observing your current situation there. What's happened?

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:10.670
It's Tony!

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:14.010
He's used the Blue to take over the medical station!

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.340
He did what!?

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:18.350
It's a complete frenzy of his B cells!

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:24.360
He's trying to collide the two stations together and destroy Second Earth!

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:25.390
Tony is?

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:33.960
He couldn't be...

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:35.330
He can't!

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:46.310
Tony...!

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:51.320
Stop! Stop this, Tony!! Tony!!

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:52.650
Yuji!?

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:57.310
You can't do this! You can't! Open your eyes, Tony!

00:19:57.390 --> 00:20:00.850
What's the matter, Yuji!? Calm down! Calm yourself down!

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:06.630
Listen closely, Yuji, Marlene.

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:09.500
We don't have the luxury of choosing steps to take.

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:12.660
The two of you must quickly storm into the medical station.

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:16.330
If you cannot stop the fury of Tony's B cells...

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:18.040
...then kill Tony.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:32.410
Kill Tony...? Me, kill Tony...?

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:37.120
Tony...?

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:44.340
Kill?

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:58.980
Yuji!

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:04.650
I will...!

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:08.320
If I cannot stop him, then I will!

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:39.590
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:45.720
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:54.870
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:54.990 --> 00:22:01.040
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.190 --> 00:22:07.460
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:14.650
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:14.840 --> 00:22:19.810
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:19.910 --> 00:22:25.870
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:32.150
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:32.760 --> 00:22:39.630
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:39.810 --> 00:22:46.490
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:51.030 --> 00:22:54.300
Ally!? But you're in league with those monsters, right?

00:22:54.370 --> 00:22:56.630
Remember it! Take it back!

00:22:56.700 --> 00:22:59.300
His consciousness is no longer any different from the Blue.

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:00.640
Wait! Don't worry!

00:23:00.710 --> 00:23:02.640
- Shoot, Marlene!
- Don't talk to me!

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:05.300
- He's here!
- Hurry, Lu!

00:23:05.380 --> 00:23:10.320
But, if you are unable to stop him... you know what, Yuji.

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:13.180
And now, it's time for Final Judgment!
